{"id":"nd5f26e4df620","url":"https://www.dental-tribune.com/news/hannover-medical-school-expands-digital-facilities-for-dental-training/","title":"Hannover Medical School expands digital facilities for dental training","source":"Dental Tribune","date":"2026-11-16T08:50:16.000Z","byline":"Dental Tribune International","image":"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/008264a9/cmVzaXplLWNyb3Aodz0yMDU0O2g9MTE1Nik6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PWpwZWcp/up/dt/2026/11/Hannover-Medical-School-expands-digital-facilities-for-dental-training.jpg","imageKind":"","imageBg":"","html":"Event <h2><a href=\"https://www.dental-tribune.com/event/expodentaria-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Expodentária 2026</a></h2> <p><strong>Location: </strong>Lisbon, Portugal</p> <p>19 - 21 November 2026</p> Event <h2><a href=\"https://www.dental-tribune.com/event/wdc-world-dental-conference-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">World Dental Conference 2026</a></h2> <p><strong>Location: </strong>Bangkok, Thailand</p> <p>26 - 27 November 2026</p> Event <h2><a href=\"https://www.dental-tribune.com/event/adf-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ADF 2026</a></h2> <p><strong>Location: </strong>Paris, France</p> <p>24 - 28 November 2026</p> <a href=\"https://www.dental-tribune.com/event/archive/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Event archive</a> <li> <a href=\"https://www.dental-tribune.com/people/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Who's who</a> </li> <ul> <li> <a href=\"https://www.dental-tribune.com/news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">News</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"https://www.dental-tribune.com/topic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Topics</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"https://www.dental-tribune.com/education/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Education</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"https://www.dental-tribune.com/c/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Business<